(4764167, 687138, 50034, '<td valign="top">Good composition &amp; great title!  However, though the whites have been maintained well, some of the blacks are a bit nondescript.  This is a consistent liability with high contrast in Basic Edit...Terribly hard to make black areas light enough to have definition while preventing the whites from blowing out.  (High Contrast is much simpler in HDR in Advanced Edit Rules!)  :)</td>', 'Good composition & great title!  However, though the whites have been maintained well, some of the blacks are a bit nondescript.  This is a consistent liability with high contrast in Basic Edit...Terribly hard to make black areas light enough to have definition while preventing the whites from blowing out.  (High Contrast is much simpler in HDR in Advanced Edit Rules!)  :)', '2008-06-11 14:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
