(4764236, 685742, 50034, '<td valign="top">Agreed!  Excellent Photo!  Posters with this type of photo (that were prevalent back in the 1970''s when I was a teen) were strong influences for me in choosing to pursue skill in photography.<br/> <br/>I think those photographers added some variety of green filter to their creations to enhance the foliage and moss in pictures, like this, but I can see a place for the stronger warmth...as in the lower left-hand corner.<br/> <br/>Good Work!  :)</td>', 'Agreed!  Excellent Photo!  Posters with this type of photo (that were prevalent back in the 1970''s when I was a teen) were strong influences for me in choosing to pursue skill in photography. I think those photographers added some variety of green filter to their creations to enhance the foliage and moss in pictures, like this, but I can see a place for the stronger warmth...as in the lower left-hand corner. Good Work!  :)', '2008-06-11 15:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
