(4764481, 687504, 53572, '<td valign="top">this is a lovely image, but i''m afraid it''s not really a high contrast image.   high contrast has a limited tonal range of high and low tones, with very few intermediate tones. the ultimate high contrast is pure black and white, no greys. the more greys or intermediate tones, the less high contrast it is.</td>', 'this is a lovely image, but i''m afraid it''s not really a high contrast image.   high contrast has a limited tonal range of high and low tones, with very few intermediate tones. the ultimate high contrast is pure black and white, no greys. the more greys or intermediate tones, the less high contrast it is.', '2008-06-11 16:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
