(4765003, 687839, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great image.  My favorite in this challenge, so far.  This is truly high contrast.... with no details lost in the highlights and not too many lost in the shadows.  Great!</td>', 'Great image.  My favorite in this challenge, so far.  This is truly high contrast.... with no details lost in the highlights and not too many lost in the shadows.  Great!', '2008-06-11 22:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
