(4766459, 686602, 16230, '<td valign="top">No doubt, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=9668" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Zoomdak</a>''s ribbon winning "Aperture" was the inspiration for this photo. Unfortunately, it falls way short of that fine image. The composition is okay, but the lighting is dull and the flocks of birds are very distracting. It''s also difficult to tell what these people are doing in the shot.</td>', 'No doubt,  Zoomdak''s ribbon winning "Aperture" was the inspiration for this photo. Unfortunately, it falls way short of that fine image. The composition is okay, but the lighting is dull and the flocks of birds are very distracting. It''s also difficult to tell what these people are doing in the shot.', '2008-06-12 17:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
