(4766784, 687342, 82985, '<td valign="top">this is mysterious, slightly surreal, and moody.  I think a slight crop in from each side could keep the composition intact, but would eliminate the distraction wake-element on the lower left.  I like the soft glow from the top of the frame.   Nice. 7</td>', 'this is mysterious, slightly surreal, and moody.  I think a slight crop in from each side could keep the composition intact, but would eliminate the distraction wake-element on the lower left.  I like the soft glow from the top of the frame.   Nice. 7', '2008-06-12 22:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766797, 687633, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like the layers of contrast here--light/dark, wet/dry, water/stone.  The composition is nicely done.  I might have thrown that twig outta the way, and might want to see the brightness of the stones dropped just a tad to reveal a touch of texture.  You nailed the water, with a clear view to the stones under it, though, and basic rules may limit this.  But later, a little burn on the dry stones might be worth a look. I like the under exposed trees--dark enough to retain an abstract feel to this composition &amp; forms, but hints of trunks so we know what it is.  7</td>', 'I like the layers of contrast here--light/dark, wet/dry, water/stone.  The composition is nicely done.  I might have thrown that twig outta the way, and might want to see the brightness of the stones dropped just a tad to reveal a touch of texture.  You nailed the water, with a clear view to the stones under it, though, and basic rules may limit this.  But later, a little burn on the dry stones might be worth a look. I like the under exposed trees--dark enough to retain an abstract feel to this composition & forms, but hints of trunks so we know what it is.  7', '2008-06-12 22:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766805, 687600, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like this, like the composition and tonality.  It seems just a bit soft to me, and a bit more local contrast (when not limited by rules) on the cracked dry mud might be cool, too.  Then you could have a bit more textural feel there. 7</td>', 'I like this, like the composition and tonality.  It seems just a bit soft to me, and a bit more local contrast (when not limited by rules) on the cracked dry mud might be cool, too.  Then you could have a bit more textural feel there. 7', '2008-06-12 22:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766806, 686858, 82985, '<td valign="top">soft, serene, well composed, with a mood and tone in the image that aligns supports the title  8</td>', 'soft, serene, well composed, with a mood and tone in the image that aligns supports the title  8', '2008-06-12 22:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766820, 687907, 82985, '<td valign="top">this is striking, well composed and executed.  Oddly, the intensity and drama of this image actually make it kind of hard for me to spend much time with it.  The dynamics in this image are amazing.  7</td>', 'this is striking, well composed and executed.  Oddly, the intensity and drama of this image actually make it kind of hard for me to spend much time with it.  The dynamics in this image are amazing.  7', '2008-06-12 22:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766825, 686413, 65234, '<td valign="top">Subject shows contrast in several senses of the word, which makes it interesting to me.  I think the focus on the sky makes sense but it isn''t visually appealing to have the window OOF, and the tilt isn''t extreme enough to look purposeful.  I think the point would still come across with the window in focus (but still silhouetted like it is now), and either extremely tilted or level.</td>', 'Subject shows contrast in several senses of the word, which makes it interesting to me.  I think the focus on the sky makes sense but it isn''t visually appealing to have the window OOF, and the tilt isn''t extreme enough to look purposeful.  I think the point would still come across with the window in focus (but still silhouetted like it is now), and either extremely tilted or level.', '2008-06-12 22:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766828, 686960, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sharp little dragonfly. I like all the blues.</td>', 'Sharp little dragonfly. I like all the blues.', '2008-06-12 22:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766831, 687741, 82985, '<td valign="top">Well seen opportunistic "street photography" sort of image. The long shadows support the "late afternoon"  feel.  If it were a bit less dark, we might actually be able to see some books--I think there are some there on the left, but not sure.  I like the tonality/color of this image.  7</td>', 'Well seen opportunistic "street photography" sort of image. The long shadows support the "late afternoon"  feel.  If it were a bit less dark, we might actually be able to see some books--I think there are some there on the left, but not sure.  I like the tonality/color of this image.  7', '2008-06-12 22:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766833, 687306, 65234, '<td valign="top">Certainly contrasty; his expression looks a little demented to me, which I happen to find more interesting than a classic smile ;-)</td>', 'Certainly contrasty; his expression looks a little demented to me, which I happen to find more interesting than a classic smile ;-)', '2008-06-12 22:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766834, 687633, 65234, '<td valign="top">It looks enormous, and surprisingly vacant.</td>', 'It looks enormous, and surprisingly vacant.', '2008-06-12 22:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766836, 687398, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice pose.  Hope he has a long, happy, healthy life.</td>', 'Very nice pose.  Hope he has a long, happy, healthy life.', '2008-06-12 22:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766837, 687192, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like an interesting place to explore.</td>', 'Looks like an interesting place to explore.', '2008-06-12 22:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766839, 687907, 65234, '<td valign="top">That doesn''t look like a friendly smile.  Image looks somewhat like a pen and ink drawing.</td>', 'That doesn''t look like a friendly smile.  Image looks somewhat like a pen and ink drawing.', '2008-06-12 22:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766845, 687854, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, my.  Wonderful color in the water and lovely composition.  The swan looks a little off-white; I''d desaturate on the blue/cyan range to make him whiter so he stood out even more.</td>', 'Oh, my.  Wonderful color in the water and lovely composition.  The swan looks a little off-white; I''d desaturate on the blue/cyan range to make him whiter so he stood out even more.', '2008-06-12 22:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766848, 686229, 65234, '<td valign="top">Just like the field in the Wizard of Oz!  Horizon looks tilted and I''m not seeing a reason why it should be.</td>', 'Just like the field in the Wizard of Oz!  Horizon looks tilted and I''m not seeing a reason why it should be.', '2008-06-12 22:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766852, 686899, 65234, '<td valign="top">Poor baby :-(  Shot is a bit soft; that''s OK with the subject and title but I''d still like to see a sharper eye.</td>', 'Poor baby :-(  Shot is a bit soft; that''s OK with the subject and title but I''d still like to see a sharper eye.', '2008-06-12 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766854, 686776, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can''t look at that fence, it''s making me dizzy!</td>', 'I can''t look at that fence, it''s making me dizzy!', '2008-06-12 22:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766857, 686859, 82985, '<td valign="top">What really makes this image work for me is the reflection in the wet pavement. The composition is very well done--the placement of the sculpture against the backdrop building, and the angle of view which gives us the two elements of the sculpture this close to touching adds a subtle tension. Layered contrasts abound in this image: light/dark, curved/rectangular, sharp/soft.  7</td>', 'What really makes this image work for me is the reflection in the wet pavement. The composition is very well done--the placement of the sculpture against the backdrop building, and the angle of view which gives us the two elements of the sculpture this close to touching adds a subtle tension. Layered contrasts abound in this image: light/dark, curved/rectangular, sharp/soft.  7', '2008-06-12 22:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766861, 687748, 82985, '<td valign="top">well done in every way.  7</td>', 'well done in every way.  7', '2008-06-12 22:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766867, 687905, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.  It has a bit of a yellow cast; I''d try correcting the white balance and/or shifting the orange/yellow range toward red and desaturating slightly to get better skin tones.</td>', 'Lovely scene.  It has a bit of a yellow cast; I''d try correcting the white balance and/or shifting the orange/yellow range toward red and desaturating slightly to get better skin tones.', '2008-06-12 22:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766878, 685508, 82985, '<td valign="top">wonderful image, well composed, care taken with the lines and flow of the image.  Nice sense of light from outside, and the model has the right sense of curious hesitant uncertain longing/waiting/wondering.  I think the title is a bit wordy--but so are these comments!  8</td>', 'wonderful image, well composed, care taken with the lines and flow of the image.  Nice sense of light from outside, and the model has the right sense of curious hesitant uncertain longing/waiting/wondering.  I think the title is a bit wordy--but so are these comments!  8', '2008-06-12 22:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766883, 687627, 82985, '<td valign="top">bright and energetic image--the tilt adds a lot to what could have been a very static shot otherwise.  It seems to have some resizing or sharpening artifacts, and I wish the top of her head was not touching the edge of the frame.  But you get a 7 from me.</td>', 'bright and energetic image--the tilt adds a lot to what could have been a very static shot otherwise.  It seems to have some resizing or sharpening artifacts, and I wish the top of her head was not touching the edge of the frame.  But you get a 7 from me.', '2008-06-12 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766889, 687446, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like it!  I wonder if it would work better as a full-up b/w, or full monotone in some other color.  But I like the composition and texture.  6</td>', 'I like it!  I wonder if it would work better as a full-up b/w, or full monotone in some other color.  But I like the composition and texture.  6', '2008-06-12 22:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766893, 686141, 82985, '<td valign="top">Probably isn''t, but this seems like New Mexico to me, where I grew up: GREAT skies in NM.  Well done in every way. 9</td>', 'Probably isn''t, but this seems like New Mexico to me, where I grew up: GREAT skies in NM.  Well done in every way. 9', '2008-06-12 22:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766896, 687743, 82985, '<td valign="top">well done. I wonder if it could go just a one or two tenths of a stop brighter and still hold texture.  But it is lovely and gets a 9</td>', 'well done. I wonder if it could go just a one or two tenths of a stop brighter and still hold texture.  But it is lovely and gets a 9', '2008-06-12 22:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766903, 687902, 82985, '<td valign="top">You will likely gets lots of love or hate on the border--I tend to ignore the borders unless they are garish and utterly inappropriate--which this one is not.  I REALLY Like this image! Beautifully composed, exposed, processed, but you also have worked multiple forms of contrast into this image: light and dark across the entire image, superb local contrast on the bud itself, sharp/soft-bokeh contrast.  The focal point and DOF choice here is superb as well.  10</td>', 'You will likely gets lots of love or hate on the border--I tend to ignore the borders unless they are garish and utterly inappropriate--which this one is not.  I REALLY Like this image! Beautifully composed, exposed, processed, but you also have worked multiple forms of contrast into this image: light and dark across the entire image, superb local contrast on the bud itself, sharp/soft-bokeh contrast.  The focal point and DOF choice here is superb as well.  10', '2008-06-12 22:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766910, 687343, 65234, '<td valign="top">Thise reflections are fabulous!  They look like stained glass.  I''d crop off most of the building above the lights to pur more emphasis on the lit signs and their reflections.</td>', 'Thise reflections are fabulous!  They look like stained glass.  I''d crop off most of the building above the lights to pur more emphasis on the lit signs and their reflections.', '2008-06-12 22:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766912, 687009, 94235, '<td valign="top">The earring takes away the focus from those beautiful eyes.</td>', 'The earring takes away the focus from those beautiful eyes.', '2008-06-12 22:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766914, 687062, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely, surreal, semi-abstract image.  I don''t care for the title, as it tends to  try and drive me to notice "hey, see, the blurry part looks kinda like an x-ray, cool, huh?" and I think this image is strong enough that I don''t need any push to spend time looking at it, nor any nudge from the title to interpret it for myself.  You know how sometimes you hear a song and you really like it, then later you see the associated music video and it is indelibly etched into your mind, forever alters your experience of that song?  Well, I was lingering on this beautiful, delicate image, then I saw the title, and now mostly the x-ray aspect is all I see.  Titles are hard, but I think less is more.  9</td>', 'This is a lovely, surreal, semi-abstract image.  I don''t care for the title, as it tends to  try and drive me to notice "hey, see, the blurry part looks kinda like an x-ray, cool, huh?" and I think this image is strong enough that I don''t need any push to spend time looking at it, nor any nudge from the title to interpret it for myself.  You know how sometimes you hear a song and you really like it, then later you see the associated music video and it is indelibly etched into your mind, forever alters your experience of that song?  Well, I was lingering on this beautiful, delicate image, then I saw the title, and now mostly the x-ray aspect is all I see.  Titles are hard, but I think less is more.  9', '2008-06-12 22:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766917, 687471, 82985, '<td valign="top">complex and intricate 8</td>', 'complex and intricate 8', '2008-06-12 22:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766924, 687504, 82985, '<td valign="top">seemingly simple, but just beautiful and well composed.  The darker colors at the top of the image add a tension, and also convey the storm and the closeness of those clouds as compared with the distant ones.  This image works on many level for me--but I love clouds, so there ya go. 9</td>', 'seemingly simple, but just beautiful and well composed.  The darker colors at the top of the image add a tension, and also convey the storm and the closeness of those clouds as compared with the distant ones.  This image works on many level for me--but I love clouds, so there ya go. 9', '2008-06-12 22:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766927, 687374, 82985, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at this, and cannot decide about the negative space at the top.  Now, I love me some good negative space, I surely do, but just can''t quite decide: if you cropped down 10% would it be better or not? Would the cloud and road seem even more luminous, or less? Either way, see, you got me paying a lot of attention here!  8!</td>', 'I keep looking at this, and cannot decide about the negative space at the top.  Now, I love me some good negative space, I surely do, but just can''t quite decide: if you cropped down 10% would it be better or not? Would the cloud and road seem even more luminous, or less? Either way, see, you got me paying a lot of attention here!  8!', '2008-06-12 23:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766942, 687143, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, the composition, and the subtle soft texture in the overcast sky. On my monitor, which I think is in calibration, the underside of the pier goes pure deep untextured black over (in my opinion) a bit much of the pier. If the support column plunged into a fairly localized pitch black area, that would be cool, but most of the underside is formless. If it could be brought out just a bit, not much at all, I think this might be an even better image than it already is.  8 from me.</td>', 'I like the subject, the composition, and the subtle soft texture in the overcast sky. On my monitor, which I think is in calibration, the underside of the pier goes pure deep untextured black over (in my opinion) a bit much of the pier. If the support column plunged into a fairly localized pitch black area, that would be cool, but most of the underside is formless. If it could be brought out just a bit, not much at all, I think this might be an even better image than it already is.  8 from me.', '2008-06-12 23:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766945, 686911, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is a spectacular composition--all the edges and corners are just right, and the placement of the tops of the skyscrapers is perfect.  You have certainly accomplished "contrast" in this, as well.  I think it might be possible to raise the values across the entire image, still have dynamic and interesting contrast, and a little more "snap" to the image, too.  But being wrong is one of my ''strengths'' and this is great just as is. 8</td>', 'This is a spectacular composition--all the edges and corners are just right, and the placement of the tops of the skyscrapers is perfect.  You have certainly accomplished "contrast" in this, as well.  I think it might be possible to raise the values across the entire image, still have dynamic and interesting contrast, and a little more "snap" to the image, too.  But being wrong is one of my ''strengths'' and this is great just as is. 8', '2008-06-12 23:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766956, 687483, 82985, '<td valign="top">so, the title makes absolutely no sense to me.  but the image SINGS.  Beautiful abstraction.  The difficulty I always have with these sorts of images is choosing the crop--some elements are always severed, etc., and it is hard to find the right composition that brings some order out of the chaos.  Obviously, this is not a problem you are afflicted with!  Very well done.  When the rules are no longer in the way, a subtle burn down of the bright elements in the lower right and upper left edge/corners might be worth a shot--keeping the brightest elements well within frame might be even better than this already is.  9</td>', 'so, the title makes absolutely no sense to me.  but the image SINGS.  Beautiful abstraction.  The difficulty I always have with these sorts of images is choosing the crop--some elements are always severed, etc., and it is hard to find the right composition that brings some order out of the chaos.  Obviously, this is not a problem you are afflicted with!  Very well done.  When the rules are no longer in the way, a subtle burn down of the bright elements in the lower right and upper left edge/corners might be worth a shot--keeping the brightest elements well within frame might be even better than this already is.  9', '2008-06-12 23:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4766962, 686824, 82985, '<td valign="top">Okay, this image just works for me, is my taste exactly (I have a similar sort of composition in my portfolio if you don''t believe me). I like the way you see, the way you composed this--the arrangment of ALL of the Many Lines in this subject is well done.  Totally an 8</td>', 'Okay, this image just works for me, is my taste exactly (I have a similar sort of composition in my portfolio if you don''t believe me). I like the way you see, the way you composed this--the arrangment of ALL of the Many Lines in this subject is well done.  Totally an 8', '2008-06-12 23:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
