(4769917, 687736, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is an amazing shot. Composition is fantastic with sharpness on girl, leading lines to out of focus boy. Trailing ribbons are perfectly framed. Impeccable exposure in what looks like a challenging lighting situation. I love it. It blew me away when I saw it. Congratulations on a wonderful image! 10</td>', 'Wow! This is an amazing shot. Composition is fantastic with sharpness on girl, leading lines to out of focus boy. Trailing ribbons are perfectly framed. Impeccable exposure in what looks like a challenging lighting situation. I love it. It blew me away when I saw it. Congratulations on a wonderful image! 10', '2008-06-15 18:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769920, 686887, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautfiful warm lighting, excellent sharpness and frozen moment. Outstanding! I gave it a 10 but if the subject had cleared the tree tops it would isolate him that much more and push you up to 11! Well done!</td>', 'Beautfiful warm lighting, excellent sharpness and frozen moment. Outstanding! I gave it a 10 but if the subject had cleared the tree tops it would isolate him that much more and push you up to 11! Well done!', '2008-06-15 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769946, 687845, 33769, '<td valign="top">I love how the high contrast makes it hard to see the face beneath the hood but if you turn your eyes just so you can make out features... great image! :)</td>', 'I love how the high contrast makes it hard to see the face beneath the hood but if you turn your eyes just so you can make out features... great image! :)', '2008-06-15 19:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769947, 687107, 33769, '<td valign="top">REALLY cool in its simplicity-and I like the use of negative space :)  (already voted now just making my way back to comment!) :)</td>', 'REALLY cool in its simplicity-and I like the use of negative space :)  (already voted now just making my way back to comment!) :)', '2008-06-15 19:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769948, 687299, 33769, '<td valign="top">nice use of negative space :) I also like the siholuette, I do kind of wonder if the sky might be more interesting with some small amount of color in it? but that''s probably just me :) (9) ! :)</td>', 'nice use of negative space :) I also like the siholuette, I do kind of wonder if the sky might be more interesting with some small amount of color in it? but that''s probably just me :) (9) ! :)', '2008-06-15 19:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769952, 687748, 33769, '<td valign="top">really beautiful detail in a high-contrast image :) nicely done; and the expression is one that makes me want to know more of the ''story'' behind the photo; the border is great because it keeps my eyes from goign outside of the frame... and overall its a lovely image :) (9)</td>', 'really beautiful detail in a high-contrast image :) nicely done; and the expression is one that makes me want to know more of the ''story'' behind the photo; the border is great because it keeps my eyes from goign outside of the frame... and overall its a lovely image :) (9)', '2008-06-15 19:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769955, 687907, 33769, '<td valign="top">I''m suddenly thinking "MR. ED" :)  I love the horses expression and the detail still remaining in the image very beautiful capture! :) (9)</td>', 'I''m suddenly thinking "MR. ED" :)  I love the horses expression and the detail still remaining in the image very beautiful capture! :) (9)', '2008-06-15 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770009, 687748, 33552, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. True to the challenge and highly emotive.</td>', 'Excellent image. True to the challenge and highly emotive.', '2008-06-15 20:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770011, 687745, 33552, '<td valign="top">Excellent! There may be a lot of splash images around these days, but this is perfect for the challenge and very well executed.</td>', 'Excellent! There may be a lot of splash images around these days, but this is perfect for the challenge and very well executed.', '2008-06-15 20:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770015, 685790, 33552, '<td valign="top">While there may be some technical flaws (apparent artifacting on high contrast borders on forehead and under the chin), this image is both seductive and powerful, making great use of both contrast and motion.</td>', 'While there may be some technical flaws (apparent artifacting on high contrast borders on forehead and under the chin), this image is both seductive and powerful, making great use of both contrast and motion.', '2008-06-15 20:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770017, 686375, 33552, '<td valign="top">Bold and colorful. A refreshing change from monochrome in this challenge.</td>', 'Bold and colorful. A refreshing change from monochrome in this challenge.', '2008-06-15 20:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770020, 687839, 33552, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Almost otherworldly. A powerful sense of motion and beautiful muted colors.</td>', 'Beautiful. Almost otherworldly. A powerful sense of motion and beautiful muted colors.', '2008-06-15 20:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770022, 687706, 33552, '<td valign="top">Powerful and well framed.</td>', 'Powerful and well framed.', '2008-06-15 20:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770026, 686549, 33552, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! The flat gray sky forces the eye down to the bright golden hues and powerful lines below.</td>', 'Gorgeous! The flat gray sky forces the eye down to the bright golden hues and powerful lines below.', '2008-06-15 20:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770029, 687741, 33552, '<td valign="top">Stark and real. The eye line from the biker to the man with the newspaper combines beautifully with the deep DOF.</td>', 'Stark and real. The eye line from the biker to the man with the newspaper combines beautifully with the deep DOF.', '2008-06-15 20:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770032, 686794, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very well done! Fabulous tonal range, dramatic lighting, and great expression.</td>', 'Very well done! Fabulous tonal range, dramatic lighting, and great expression.', '2008-06-15 20:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770036, 687627, 33552, '<td valign="top">While I''d like to see a more expressive pose from the model, this is a fantastic, and dramatic, image. Great use of leading lines and bold color.</td>', 'While I''d like to see a more expressive pose from the model, this is a fantastic, and dramatic, image. Great use of leading lines and bold color.', '2008-06-15 20:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770043, 685898, 33552, '<td valign="top">While I''m generally not a huge fan of cool tones, this is a fantastic fairytale image. Perhaps you were taking a bit too long to set up this shot. Apparently, he is not amused.</td>', 'While I''m generally not a huge fan of cool tones, this is a fantastic fairytale image. Perhaps you were taking a bit too long to set up this shot. Apparently, he is not amused.', '2008-06-15 20:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770048, 686887, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great action shot! A lower angle might have put him above the tree line, but the highlights on the board provide great separation anyway.</td>', 'Great action shot! A lower angle might have put him above the tree line, but the highlights on the board provide great separation anyway.', '2008-06-15 20:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770056, 687533, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. The OOF flowers lead my eye up to the in-focus flower, however this feels unnatural in a way. If the background flowers created more of a curve towards a more centered subject this might work better, or you could add more black space above and on the left to balance the shot a bit. I think it''s the lack of support (stem, etc.) for the subject flower which is very high in the frame that I find disconcerting. Sorry to ramble on. Feel free to PM me if you would like me to try explaining that again.</td>', 'Nice colors. The OOF flowers lead my eye up to the in-focus flower, however this feels unnatural in a way. If the background flowers created more of a curve towards a more centered subject this might work better, or you could add more black space above and on the left to balance the shot a bit. I think it''s the lack of support (stem, etc.) for the subject flower which is very high in the frame that I find disconcerting. Sorry to ramble on. Feel free to PM me if you would like me to try explaining that again.', '2008-06-15 20:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770058, 687605, 33552, '<td valign="top">Stunning clarity and rich color. Nicely done.</td>', 'Stunning clarity and rich color. Nicely done.', '2008-06-15 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770061, 687494, 33552, '<td valign="top">Bold in it''s symmetry, and it''s lack thereof. Too bad the top of the flower slips out of focus, otherwise nice sharp edges in this isolation.</td>', 'Bold in it''s symmetry, and it''s lack thereof. Too bad the top of the flower slips out of focus, otherwise nice sharp edges in this isolation.', '2008-06-15 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770063, 686462, 33552, '<td valign="top">Simple and casual, though I''d like to see a bit more of their surroundings to complete the story.</td>', 'Simple and casual, though I''d like to see a bit more of their surroundings to complete the story.', '2008-06-15 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770064, 687743, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great texture and framing!</td>', 'Great texture and framing!', '2008-06-15 20:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770066, 687862, 33552, '<td valign="top">Bold and powerful. I''d either include more of the building on the right to create a juxtaposition of old and new, or avoid it entirely.</td>', 'Bold and powerful. I''d either include more of the building on the right to create a juxtaposition of old and new, or avoid it entirely.', '2008-06-15 20:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770068, 687863, 33552, '<td valign="top">Elegant, if a bit severe. Good separation on the highlight side, but the entirely missing ear in an otherwise frontal portrait is a bit disconcerting. Try turning the head until there is just a hint of ear on the far side.</td>', 'Elegant, if a bit severe. Good separation on the highlight side, but the entirely missing ear in an otherwise frontal portrait is a bit disconcerting. Try turning the head until there is just a hint of ear on the far side.', '2008-06-15 21:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770069, 687704, 33552, '<td valign="top">Dramatic and well lit. I''d prefer a vertical crop here if possible.</td>', 'Dramatic and well lit. I''d prefer a vertical crop here if possible.', '2008-06-15 21:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770070, 687420, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great eyes, and no major distractions. Well done.</td>', 'Great eyes, and no major distractions. Well done.', '2008-06-15 21:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770071, 686440, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very good concept. A second light or reflector on the left would help a lot here to reduce shadows, grain, and the yellowing inside the flower.</td>', 'Very good concept. A second light or reflector on the left would help a lot here to reduce shadows, grain, and the yellowing inside the flower.', '2008-06-15 21:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770073, 687599, 33552, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Full of texture. The person helps give a sense of scale.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Full of texture. The person helps give a sense of scale.', '2008-06-15 21:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770076, 687854, 33552, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. I wonder if partially desaturating the blues would help the swan stand out even more.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. I wonder if partially desaturating the blues would help the swan stand out even more.', '2008-06-15 21:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770077, 685851, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great color and texture!</td>', 'Great color and texture!', '2008-06-15 21:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770078, 687483, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great! The competing gradients on the surface and the droplets create an almost unnatural sense of depth.</td>', 'Great! The competing gradients on the surface and the droplets create an almost unnatural sense of depth.', '2008-06-15 21:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770079, 687063, 33552, '<td valign="top">Simple and emotive, with fine texture in the foreground.</td>', 'Simple and emotive, with fine texture in the foreground.', '2008-06-15 21:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770092, 687183, 91150, '<td valign="top">A little dark, and whats that white thing in the top left corner? Very pretty. 8</td>', 'A little dark, and whats that white thing in the top left corner? Very pretty. 8', '2008-06-15 21:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770103, 685982, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great use of contrast to increase the drama and tension in this image.</td>', 'Great use of contrast to increase the drama and tension in this image.', '2008-06-15 21:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770109, 687598, 33552, '<td valign="top">Fascinating pattern.  Stands out nicely from the smooth orange background. I''m not sure if a small reflector would be practical, but it would help even out the lighting a bit.</td>', 'Fascinating pattern.  Stands out nicely from the smooth orange background. I''m not sure if a small reflector would be practical, but it would help even out the lighting a bit.', '2008-06-15 21:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770110, 687905, 33552, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pattern and colors. The negative space helps a lot here, though a bit less empty stage at the bottom might help.</td>', 'Beautiful pattern and colors. The negative space helps a lot here, though a bit less empty stage at the bottom might help.', '2008-06-15 21:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770112, 687471, 33552, '<td valign="top">Beautiful patterns and colors. Nice use of infrared to increase contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful patterns and colors. Nice use of infrared to increase contrast.', '2008-06-15 21:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770117, 687736, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and dramatic! The wind catching her hair and headdress intensifies the sense of motion in this image. I had to bump this up a point during commenting. It''s a fantastic image.</td>', 'Very elegant and dramatic! The wind catching her hair and headdress intensifies the sense of motion in this image. I had to bump this up a point during commenting. It''s a fantastic image.', '2008-06-15 21:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770123, 687374, 33552, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky and lighting! Powerful image.</td>', 'Dramatic sky and lighting! Powerful image.', '2008-06-15 21:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770124, 687897, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great eyes and expression.</td>', 'Great eyes and expression.', '2008-06-15 21:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770131, 686683, 33552, '<td valign="top">Cool muscle pattern! A bit hot between the shoulder blades, and a touch of back lighting to define the outline of the body would probably add a lot here. Also a slightly higher camera angle might help to de-emphasize the back pockets on the pants.</td>', 'Cool muscle pattern! A bit hot between the shoulder blades, and a touch of back lighting to define the outline of the body would probably add a lot here. Also a slightly higher camera angle might help to de-emphasize the back pockets on the pants.', '2008-06-15 21:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770134, 686485, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but the near cheek is a bit hot for my tastes. Also, the cool tones in the hair and face look unnatural, but not bold enough to look deliberate. Very cool background!</td>', 'Nice portrait, but the near cheek is a bit hot for my tastes. Also, the cool tones in the hair and face look unnatural, but not bold enough to look deliberate. Very cool background!', '2008-06-15 21:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770152, 687336, 33552, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene! Two of them in fact. It''s a little tough to decide what to look at. My eyes keep bouncing from the mountains to the foreground log and back again, when what I think I want to look at is the reflection. A square or landscape framing might help, but you really have two shots here. The mountains and reflection, or the foreground vegetation with a bit less background. Beautiful colors and clarity.</td>', 'Beautiful scene! Two of them in fact. It''s a little tough to decide what to look at. My eyes keep bouncing from the mountains to the foreground log and back again, when what I think I want to look at is the reflection. A square or landscape framing might help, but you really have two shots here. The mountains and reflection, or the foreground vegetation with a bit less background. Beautiful colors and clarity.', '2008-06-15 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1);
