(4773834, 687745, 90624, '<td valign="top">So glad to see something other then a black and white take first on this when I went back and looked at the past High Contrast challenges it seems that people only wanted black and white.. as if that is the only way to show high contrast!! I didn''t get a chance to enter this one was on vacation. But many congrats I love the shot and can only hope to become this good!!<br/> <br/>~D~</td>', 'So glad to see something other then a black and white take first on this when I went back and looked at the past High Contrast challenges it seems that people only wanted black and white.. as if that is the only way to show high contrast!! I didn''t get a chance to enter this one was on vacation. But many congrats I love the shot and can only hope to become this good!! ~D~', '2008-06-18 02:42:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4773838, 687706, 44877, '<td valign="top">OMG OMG!!! Jon - I''m so happy for you! This blows everything right out of the water - PB, top 20, several favs - wow wow wow!!!<br/> <br/>Awesome photo and well deserved. Yay for you!!!!</td>', 'OMG OMG!!! Jon - I''m so happy for you! This blows everything right out of the water - PB, top 20, several favs - wow wow wow!!! Awesome photo and well deserved. Yay for you!!!!', '2008-06-18 02:46:19.000000', NULL, 0),
