(4773854, 686413, 77192, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote on this in the challenge but would have given it at least a 7 I would have thought. It''s <u><b>very</b></u> highly underrated in my opinion, particularly as you''ve combined high contrast in tones with contrast in theme between freedom/imprisonment. I suspect most voters didn''t pick up on that theme, hence your score.<br/> <br/>I''m certainly inclined to agree with some of your other commenters regarding the focus, although I think the angle is fine as it is. I also like that there''s a lot of black in the photo too, it conveys the darkness of mood one might have if one were imprisoned.<br/> <br/>Other than that - take heart - you''ve done pretty well on your first entry, even though the score doesn''t reflect that. You''ve obviously got the eye and creativity to do well in later challenges. Good luck!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-18 02:30:41.</i></td>', 'I didn''t get to vote on this in the challenge but would have given it at least a 7 I would have thought. It''s very highly underrated in my opinion, particularly as you''ve combined high contrast in tones with contrast in theme between freedom/imprisonment. I suspect most voters didn''t pick up on that theme, hence your score. I''m certainly inclined to agree with some of your other commenters regarding the focus, although I think the angle is fine as it is. I also like that there''s a lot of black in the photo too, it conveys the darkness of mood one might have if one were imprisoned. Other than that - take heart - you''ve done pretty well on your first entry, even though the score doesn''t reflect that. You''ve obviously got the eye and creativity to do well in later challenges. Good luck!', '2008-06-18 03:04:23.000000', '2008-06-18 03:30:41.000000', 0),
(4773855, 687062, 38477, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments :)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments :)', '2008-06-18 03:04:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4773856, 687758, 14620, '<td valign="top">Kris, is this your wee one?!?  Beautiful, beautiful image and congratulations!! :)</td>', 'Kris, is this your wee one?!?  Beautiful, beautiful image and congratulations!! :)', '2008-06-18 03:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4773857, 687902, 44877, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this photo, Sarah. This is one of those images where you shouldn''t be concerned with the score, because it is so arty and exquisite. That said - I just looked at most of the challenge, and though there are many excellent submissions, I''m mystified as to why yours did not score higher. As you mentioned, the commenters'' votes provide an enormous gap to the general votes. <br/> <br/>Soldier on! With the ability to create such beautiful art, you are really onto something that is beyond this one website. <br/> <br/>I''ll email you tomorrow morning  - off to bed now!<br/> <br/>OX</td>', 'I really, really like this photo, Sarah. This is one of those images where you shouldn''t be concerned with the score, because it is so arty and exquisite. That said - I just looked at most of the challenge, and though there are many excellent submissions, I''m mystified as to why yours did not score higher. As you mentioned, the commenters'' votes provide an enormous gap to the general votes.  Soldier on! With the ability to create such beautiful art, you are really onto something that is beyond this one website.  I''ll email you tomorrow morning  - off to bed now! OX', '2008-06-18 03:06:57.000000', NULL, 0),
