(4774015, 687745, 23430, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot. Well done. Never thought of using oil. Good idea.</td>', 'Brilliant shot. Well done. Never thought of using oil. Good idea.', '2008-06-18 04:46:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4774024, 687745, 30807, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!<br/> <br/>I suspect the thickness of the oil is why the mass of ''coffee'' round the middle of the picture looks very glutinous, almost like lava flow. I would love to see the coffee shots to compare. <br/> <br/>Brilliant idea to use oil. As an aside, have you ever mixed cornflour with cold water, and poured it. The mixture is amazing - drops slowly, acts very strangely, and if thick enough just pulls off any flat surface without leaving any mess - try it and see. Amaze friends at parties and all that sort of rubbish - but pouring a spoon of it, makes very odd photos.</td>', 'Very nice shot! I suspect the thickness of the oil is why the mass of ''coffee'' round the middle of the picture looks very glutinous, almost like lava flow. I would love to see the coffee shots to compare.  Brilliant idea to use oil. As an aside, have you ever mixed cornflour with cold water, and poured it. The mixture is amazing - drops slowly, acts very strangely, and if thick enough just pulls off any flat surface without leaving any mess - try it and see. Amaze friends at parties and all that sort of rubbish - but pouring a spoon of it, makes very odd photos.', '2008-06-18 05:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4774031, 686794, 41337, '<td valign="top">With IreneM winning all the ribbons and you all of the honorable mentions (plus ribbons) there''s not a whole lot left for the rest of us.</td>', 'With IreneM winning all the ribbons and you all of the honorable mentions (plus ribbons) there''s not a whole lot left for the rest of us.', '2008-06-18 05:26:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4774036, 687885, 34462, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the highly focused edge (and point) to the softness of everything else, no to mention th colors.<br/></td>', 'I like the contrast between the highly focused edge (and point) to the softness of everything else, no to mention th colors.', '2008-06-18 05:35:07.000000', NULL, 0),
