(4774057, 687745, 67319, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! Good job, but I sorta agree with ypu it too bad the splash isn''t symmetrical. Still a cool shot. Condrats!</td>', 'Awesome shot! Good job, but I sorta agree with ypu it too bad the splash isn''t symmetrical. Still a cool shot. Condrats!', '2008-06-18 06:05:05.000000', NULL, 0),
