(4774077, 687745, 42171, '<td valign="top">Great shot!<br/> <br/>You can see by the way the fluid is bulging over the edge of the cup that it is something thicker than water.<br/> <br/>What was the cup sitting on as I can''t imagine old engine oil cleaning up very well! Large sheets of white paper would be my guess.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the Blue and you new PB.<br/> <br/>AL.</td>', 'Great shot! You can see by the way the fluid is bulging over the edge of the cup that it is something thicker than water. What was the cup sitting on as I can''t imagine old engine oil cleaning up very well! Large sheets of white paper would be my guess. Congrats on the Blue and you new PB. AL.', '2008-06-18 06:51:29.000000', NULL, 0),
