(4774462, 686413, 65234, '<td valign="top">Just saw your forum post about this entry.  I don''t know if I was clear in my comment but straightening in post-processing was what I was thinking.  I know one often has to take shots at a slightly odd angle to avoid unwanted elements.  But if you had straightened it I would have had less to comment on ;-)<br/> <br/>BTW, I gave you a 6, and really did find this a thoughtful take on the challenge.</td>', 'Just saw your forum post about this entry.  I don''t know if I was clear in my comment but straightening in post-processing was what I was thinking.  I know one often has to take shots at a slightly odd angle to avoid unwanted elements.  But if you had straightened it I would have had less to comment on ;-) BTW, I gave you a 6, and really did find this a thoughtful take on the challenge.', '2008-06-18 11:01:22.000000', NULL, 0),
