(4775188, 687654, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK dont hate me but...I did prefer the orange version <br/> <br/>Having said that I have to say that I thought this met the challenge in spades, great composition, super high contrast and the hint of blue in the sky shows that this is not just another black and white shot (and so therefore is technically harder to deliver)<br/> <br/>Forget the voters, this is a great shot and definitely one to be proud of</td>', 'OK dont hate me but...I did prefer the orange version  Having said that I have to say that I thought this met the challenge in spades, great composition, super high contrast and the hint of blue in the sky shows that this is not just another black and white shot (and so therefore is technically harder to deliver) Forget the voters, this is a great shot and definitely one to be proud of', '2008-06-18 18:18:27.000000', NULL, 0),
