(4775315, 686814, 20608, '<td valign="top">Mate! So sorry about the DQ. I know that blasted Fuji resets the date when you change the battery. well hopefully now you have the 10D this kind of crap wont happen to you again. Im pretty sure this would of been a new personal best.<br/> <br/>Cheer up dude, better times are ahead, enjoy the 10D and the Sigma 17-70, great kit.</td>', 'Mate! So sorry about the DQ. I know that blasted Fuji resets the date when you change the battery. well hopefully now you have the 10D this kind of crap wont happen to you again. Im pretty sure this would of been a new personal best. Cheer up dude, better times are ahead, enjoy the 10D and the Sigma 17-70, great kit.', '2008-06-18 20:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4775331, 687897, 67145, '<td valign="top">brilliant process .. i''m seeing this in the before and after thread by the way .. but congratulations on your excellent place in the challenge .. love those eyes and that cheeky expression .. it looks like she just loves having a bath AND having her picture taken .. lucky you .. i have to just about beg ppl if i want to take their photograph .. i have to be very sneaky .. !!..:)</td>', 'brilliant process .. i''m seeing this in the before and after thread by the way .. but congratulations on your excellent place in the challenge .. love those eyes and that cheeky expression .. it looks like she just loves having a bath AND having her picture taken .. lucky you .. i have to just about beg ppl if i want to take their photograph .. i have to be very sneaky .. !!..:)', '2008-06-18 20:27:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4775353, 687706, 33769, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful photo :) and I never deduct for those pesky dust-spots ;)  I gave it a 10  and i''m very glad it hit your PB this time around! :)  - its powerful, symmetrical, a perfect example of high contrast and I love it :)</td>', 'this is a beautiful photo :) and I never deduct for those pesky dust-spots ;)  I gave it a 10  and i''m very glad it hit your PB this time around! :)  - its powerful, symmetrical, a perfect example of high contrast and I love it :)', '2008-06-18 20:53:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4775357, 687745, 18563, '<td valign="top">I actually didn''t even use a flash on this one. I used the most powerful light source i know of...then sun! Set up was pretty simple. I had an old white particle board set on top of 2 crates and a white construction paper back drop taped to the side of my house about 2 feet behind the mug. I put a TON of newspaper below to catch any stray drops of oil. After I felt that i got my shot (or just sick of cleaning up) i burned everything...except the mug.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=689977'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=689977'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=689977"/> <br/>Here is one of the pictures taken right after the one I submitted for the challenge.</td>', 'I actually didn''t even use a flash on this one. I used the most powerful light source i know of...then sun! Set up was pretty simple. I had an old white particle board set on top of 2 crates and a white construction paper back drop taped to the side of my house about 2 feet behind the mug. I put a TON of newspaper below to catch any stray drops of oil. After I felt that i got my shot (or just sick of cleaning up) i burned everything...except the mug. Here is one of the pictures taken right after the one I submitted for the challenge.', '2008-06-18 21:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
