(4776243, 687238, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, not a single comment, and no explanations for the low scores. That stinks. I think this is very appropriate for the high contrast challenge, and I like the duotone/partial desat. I like the subject and the composition. I can see why it didn''t blow away the voters (no action, no sunset, no beautiful girl, no cleaver set-up), but I can''t understand all the low votes.</td>', 'Wow, not a single comment, and no explanations for the low scores. That stinks. I think this is very appropriate for the high contrast challenge, and I like the duotone/partial desat. I like the subject and the composition. I can see why it didn''t blow away the voters (no action, no sunset, no beautiful girl, no cleaver set-up), but I can''t understand all the low votes.', '2008-06-19 11:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776289, 687801, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. The high contrast is excellent. And there is sort of a Yin/Yang effect with the light and dark sides of the sheep contrasting with the light and dark shadows of the barn.</td>', 'I really like this image. The high contrast is excellent. And there is sort of a Yin/Yang effect with the light and dark sides of the sheep contrasting with the light and dark shadows of the barn.', '2008-06-19 12:00:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776297, 686292, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oh, BEAUTIFUL! How funny of you, who almost always does b&amp;w, to post a color photo for the high contrast challenge. I think you may be entering a new phase in your art. This is in the same realm as Insectivora, which I also really liked.</td>', 'Oh, BEAUTIFUL! How funny of you, who almost always does b&w, to post a color photo for the high contrast challenge. I think you may be entering a new phase in your art. This is in the same realm as Insectivora, which I also really liked.', '2008-06-19 12:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776301, 687885, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the yummy shallow DOF in this image. The colors are beautiful. I don''t consider this high contrast, but I really like the image.</td>', 'Love the yummy shallow DOF in this image. The colors are beautiful. I don''t consider this high contrast, but I really like the image.', '2008-06-19 12:10:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776307, 687364, 66384, '<td valign="top">Hey, I recognize this outfit from the Cowboy challenge. Looks better on you than on the hanger. :) Good shot Brian. Nice high contrast, especially in the hat, shirt, and collar tip. I like your title too. <br/> <br/>I like the shot the way it is, but I wonder if you had cropped it down to a standard portrait (including the hat and collar point) if it would have scored higher for this High Contrast challenge.</td>', 'Hey, I recognize this outfit from the Cowboy challenge. Looks better on you than on the hanger. :) Good shot Brian. Nice high contrast, especially in the hat, shirt, and collar tip. I like your title too.  I like the shot the way it is, but I wonder if you had cropped it down to a standard portrait (including the hat and collar point) if it would have scored higher for this High Contrast challenge.', '2008-06-19 12:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776315, 686658, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is cool! It''s almost abstract, yet the subject is very clear. I like the bright trail and dark plane against all the waves of light and dark gray.</td>', 'This is cool! It''s almost abstract, yet the subject is very clear. I like the bright trail and dark plane against all the waves of light and dark gray.', '2008-06-19 12:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
